# Student panel quality standard

The student panel is the flagship product. Prioritize polish over feature count.

## Before marking any student feature complete

- UI works on mobile and desktop
- Loading: skeleton (not plain "Loading…" text alone)
- Error: inline card with retry, not toast-only
- Empty: helpful copy + clear CTAs to next action
- Actions: instant feedback (disabled state, optimistic remove where safe)
- No layout shift when data arrives
- No dead buttons or placeholder flows
- RPC/DB failures handled gracefully

## Prefer

- `StudentPanelStates` components for skeletons and errors
- Optimistic UI for mark-done / dismiss actions (avoid reload that re-fetches stale data)
- One polished flow over multiple half-finished screens

## Quality over feature count

If choosing between many buggy features vs fewer polished ones, choose fewer polished ones.
